Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 21:36:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Receive explicit camera lane positions without changing OEM
 permissions

Query lane position separately from navigation snapshots; validate expiry and session matching, render exact numbered lanes, and invalidate on route mismatch or inconsistent lane counts. Keep a separate installable test app variant.

Validation: Android APK builds; 301 unit tests pass, one existing test skipped.

